        "pseudocode": "Algorithm FindCongruenceCycle(f, rho, x):\n1. Tortoise = f(x), Hare = f(f(x))\n2. While Tortoise != Hare: advance tortoise 1 step, hare 2 steps\n3. Reset tortoise to x, advance both 1 step until meeting\n4. Count cycle length from meeting point\nTime: O(m + k), Space: O(1)"
